WEBVTT

00:58:28.708 --> 00:58:31.662
We may decide not to,
in which case, we won't do it.

00:58:31.686 --> 00:58:36.576
But the issue of whether
a spaceship can get there

00:58:36.600 --> 00:58:38.994
is a matter of what we decide to do ...

00:58:39.962 --> 00:58:42.365
CA: Now, if you enjoyed today's episode,

00:58:42.389 --> 00:58:46.446
please rate and review on Apple Podcasts
or wherever you're listening,

00:58:46.470 --> 00:58:51.867
or find some other way of sharing
with anyone you know who is curious.

00:58:51.891 --> 00:58:53.593
Thank you for listening.